---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";


import favImage1 from "../assets/imagini/first-page/favorite-projectes-1.jpg";
import favImage2 from "../assets/imagini/first-page/favorite-projectes-2.jpg";
import favImage3 from "../assets/imagini/first-page/favorite-projectes-3.jpg";
import favImage4 from "../assets/imagini/first-page/favorite-projectes-4.jpg";
---
<section class="favorite-projects-wrapper">
    <div class="favorite-projects-header">
        <p>VALENTIN TAPARDEA</p>
        <h6>PROIECTE DE SUFLET</h6>
    </div>
    <div class="favorite-projects">
         <div class="favorite-projects-options">
            <p data-id="nunti" class="selected">Nunti</p>
            <p data-id="lifestyle">Lifestyle</p>
            <p data-id="thrashthedress">Trash the dress</p>
            <p data-id="studio">Studio</p>
         </div>
         <div class="favorite-projects-image">
            <Image data-id="nunti" src={favImage1} alt="imagine" style="display: block;" />   
            <Image data-id="lifestyle" src={favImage2} alt="imagine" style="display: none;" />
            <Image data-id="thrashthedress" src={favImage3} alt="imagine" style="display: none;" />
            <Image data-id="studio" src={favImage4} alt="imagine" style="display: none;" />
         </div>
         <div class="favorite-projects-info">
            <div data-id="nunti" style="display: block;">
                <p>Arta fotografiei de zi cu zi, în stil de viață își propune în principal să surprindă portrete ale oamenilor în situații, evenimente din viața reală într-o manieră artistică.</p>
                <p>Scopul principal este de a spune povești despre viețile oamenilor sau de a inspira oamenii în vremuri diferite.</p>
                <a href="/">CERE OFERTA</a>
            </div>
            <div data-id="lifestyle" style="display: none;">
                <p>Sclipici sclipici culoar pentru totdeauna salată fericită Va cabină foto fotograf limuzină, chitară bas acustic mama biserică tată domnișoară de onoare.</p>
                <a href="/">CERE OFERTA</a>
            </div>
            <div data-id="thrashthedress" style="display: none;">
                <p>Noroc photobooth fotograf limuzin buchet şampanie inel mama, sclipici beat groomsman penibil tort desert.
                    Colegii jenant tort desert chitara bas acustic, florar prea scump sarbatoresc voal flori frumoase Will voal dans sclipici.</p>
                <a href="/">CERE OFERTA</a>
            </div>
            <div data-id="studio" style="display: none;">
                <p>Toast inel biserica tata domnisoara de onoare nunta prea scump florar mama Will. Mame tort desert buchet centre de piesa sarbatoresc paiete smoking tata domnisoara de onoare sarbatoreste.
                    Voal smoking dans tatăl domnișoară de onoare urale toast, culoar Will biserica chitară acustic bas toast unitate.</p>
                <a href="/">CERE OFERTA</a>
            </div>
         </div>
    </div>
</section>


<style lang="scss">
@use "../styles/variables/index.scss" as *;


    .favorite-projects-options p.selected {
        border-bottom: 1px solid $font-color;
        cursor: pointer;
}

    .favorite-projects-wrapper {
        @include flex-center-col;
        padding: 12rem 0;
    }


    .favorite-projects-header {
        text-align: center;

        >p {
            @include para-crimson;
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 100;
        }

        > h6 {
            @include headers;
            font-size: 6rem;
            font-weight: 100;
            letter-spacing: 1.2rem;
        }
    }

    .favorite-projects {
        @include flex-center;
        gap: 4rem;
        margin-top: 4rem;
    }

    .favorite-projects-image {
        width: 100%;

        >img {
            height: 50rem;
            object-fit: cover;
        }
        
    }


    .favorite-projects-options,
     .favorite-projects-info {
        max-width: 40rem;
        width: 100%
    }

    .favorite-projects-options {
        @include flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 2rem;  
        
        > p {
            @include para-crimson;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
        } 
    }

    .favorite-projects-info {

        >div {
            @include flex-center-col;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        > div > p {
            @include para-crimson;
        }

        > div > a {
            @include para-crimson;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
            border: 1px solid $font-color;;
            align-self: self-start;
            margin-top: 2rem;
            transition: all 300ms ease;
        }

        > div > a:hover {
            border: 1px solid $greys-back;
        }
    }



</style>

<script>
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const options = document.querySelectorAll('.favorite-projects-options p');
    const images = document.querySelectorAll('.favorite-projects-image [data-id]');
    const infoSections = document.querySelectorAll('.favorite-projects-info > div');

    // Function to handle displaying the selected option's content and underline effect
    function selectOption(option) {
        const id = option.getAttribute('data-id');

        // Remove 'selected' class from all options and hide all images and info sections
        options.forEach(opt => opt.classList.remove('selected'));
        images.forEach(image => image.style.display = 'none');
        infoSections.forEach(section => section.style.display = 'none');

        // Add 'selected' class to the clicked option
        option.classList.add('selected');

        // Show the corresponding image and info section
        document.querySelector(`.favorite-projects-image [data-id="${id}"]`).style.display = 'flex';
        document.querySelector(`.favorite-projects-info [data-id="${id}"]`).style.display = 'flex';
    }

    // Set the default state (first option selected)
    selectOption(options[0]);

    // Attach click event listeners to each option
    options.forEach(option => {
        option.addEventListener('click', () => {
            selectOption(option);
        });
    });
});
</script>